{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1207498-fae-mien","id":1207498,"title":"Fae Mien","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-15T20:00:27-07:00","id":1207498,"title":"Fae Mien","content":"Ok, something I've always wondered...even from 20 years ago when I started playing CtD.<br /> <br /> I'd like an opinion, or a house rule, or some insight into what everyone does because this has always confused me.<br /> <br /> When exactly is a fae mien visible?<br /> <br /> Do other Changelings see it all the time? And what about other WoD critters if you are playing in a campaign that has all of them and uses their individual books and ruleset?<br /> <br /> Please forgive the noobness (which is strange but expected since coming back to the game after 20 years).<br /> <br /> I'd love the community's views. (forgive me if this has been asked before...I may have missed those posts)<br /> <br /> Thanks,<br /> <br /> Scrib","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24122-scribix","name":"Scribix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T20:14:04-07:00","id":1207506,"title":"","content":"Their fae mein is, generally, part of chimerical reality.<br /> <br /> Meaning all fae (and Kinain) can see it and interact with it. And as per normal, anything non-fae (mortals, the other WoD splats, etc) can't see it. I believe the only time that the mein can be seen by non-fae is when you Unleash, or Enchant a mortal.<br /> <br /> If there are ways of bypassing it via the other WoD splats' powers, I'm unaware of them.<br /> <br /> (for instance, if there is an official spread of Spheres that would allow a mage to see their mein and chimerical reality, I have no idea what it is)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4418,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","user":"tasti man LH","date":". 04-15-2018, 11:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T20:21:47-07:00","id":1207509,"title":"","content":"If you can see a chimera, you can see the fae mein. If the Changeling currently cannot see Chimera or whatnot, then they won't have a fae mein to see baring a good Kenning roll.<br /> <br /> There can also be powers for other supernaturals that would let them see the fae mein without seeing all the Chimera everywhere, such as with Imbued Hunters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10243-zenten","name":"zenten","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10243_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"488"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T21:28:17-07:00","id":1207532,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1207498-fae-mien?p=1207506#post1207506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> (for instance, if there is an official spread of Spheres that would allow a mage to see their mein and chimerical reality, I have no idea what it is)</div> </div> </div> </div>spirit 1 Mind 1 its in freeholds and glens","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T22:42:49-07:00","id":1207548,"title":"","content":"If the non-changeling is Enchanted she can see the Fae Mien:<br /> The Garou can see it with the Pulse of Invisible if she is aware of the chimerical reality.<br /> Vampires can drink changeling blood to get enchanted or can use Mytherceria's 2nd Level: Fae Sight to have the same result.<br /> <br /> Also you can Call the Wyrd to force your Fae Mien onto mundane reality.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/562-lachdanan","name":"Lachdanan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar562_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T05:16:45-07:00","id":1207615,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lachdanan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1207498-fae-mien?p=1207548#post1207548\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If the non-changeling is Enchanted she can see the Fae Mien:<br /> The Garou can see it with the Pulse of Invisible if she is aware of the chimerical reality.<br /> Vampires can drink changeling blood to get enchanted or can use Mytherceria's 2nd Level: Fae Sight to have the same result.<br /> <br /> Also you can Call the Wyrd to force your Fae Mien onto mundane reality.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait, Pulse of the Invisible does that? Does it describe things as basically seeing weird stuff everywhere in most places?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10243-zenten","name":"zenten","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10243_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"488"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T11:05:32-07:00","id":1207711,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>zenten</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1207498-fae-mien?p=1207615#post1207615\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wait, Pulse of the Invisible does that? Does it describe things as basically seeing weird stuff everywhere in most places?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yep, check the Book of Storyteller Secrets, pg. 7. But the Garou must know what she should look for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/562-lachdanan","name":"Lachdanan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar562_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T11:24:35-07:00","id":1207720,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lachdanan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1207498-fae-mien?p=1207711#post1207711\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Yep, check the Book of Storyteller Secrets, pg. 7. But the Garou must know what she should look for.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh! That explains why it's not a weird drug trip every time it's activated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10243-zenten","name":"zenten","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10243_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"488"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}